  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Consider it the pressed flower of handbags. Crafted in pebbled leather with an embossed floral design, our Thompson Street Floral satchel is in full bloom. A center zip compartment and interior pockets keep your commute organized without the chaos. Keep it forever.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled leather</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Silver hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Handle Drop:</strong> Handle drop: 4.3&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Removeable and adjustable crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop at center hole</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Open top with center zip compartment closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 13.8&quot; (L) x 8.9&quot; (H) x 5.30&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
